!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = skin type: non-lesional
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 5mm skin punch biopsies were stored in PaxGene tissue containers (PreAnalytiX) at -80°C until isolation of total RNA with the Qiagen AllPrep DNA/RNA Mini Kit preceded by an additional disruption/homogenization step with innuSPEED Lysis Tubes W (Analytik Jena) and Qiagen QIAshredder spin-columns.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA samples were prepared for sequencing using the Illumina Truseq® Stranded total RNA Protocol in combination with the RiboZero rRNA removal Kit and sequenced on the HiSeq2500 with 2x125bp.
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina standard primers were trimmed
!Sample_data_processing = Paired reads were mapped to the human reference genome (b37) using STAR
!Sample_data_processing = Number of reads for each gene was counted using HTSeq
